nginx-configuration
 inventory.ini
 ansible.conf
 playbook.yml
 roles
    nginx
        tasks/main.yml--The main list of actions that the role performs.
        templates/index.html.j2--Jinja2 templates that can be rendered and transferred to managed hosts
        files/index.html--Static files that need to be transferred to managed hosts.
        handlers/--Tasks that are triggered by changes in other tasks, typically used for actions like restarting services.
        defaults/main.yml--Default variables for the role, which can be overridden.
        vars/main.yml--internal veriables with higher precedence
        meta--role metadata and dependencies

---
- name: Install httpd
  hosts: all
  become: true

  tasks:
  - name: install httpd
    apt:
        name: httpd
        state: present

